24
00:02:13,740 --> 00:02:14,900
As expected of Master !

25
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:17,730
I can't believe you managed to hide like this.

26
00:02:40,820 --> 00:02:42,660
Is this thing also a Celestial Beast Feed ?

27
00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:44,700
I'm unsure who is eating whom...

28
00:02:45,140 --> 00:02:47,060
I can handle a few Celestial Beast Feeds
